ScriptedStore failure. They assert source context, guard, pending conversation/approval, draft, saved document and protected bytes unchanged, restore storage, resolve with the same guard once, reject a consumed resolution, and verify Archive keeps history while Discard removes it. All four fail against original G6 at guard preservation, then pass after the fix. Broader22Harness/10onboarding/5setup-read tests, strict Clippy and formatting pass. All raw failures and reviewed sources retained.\n\nG6 all19natives/C43full24/48/performance25.065583ms/check06all18/C29attempt09full9 remain immutable historical qualification; complete950-file exactexe archive retained before the fix. Changed production bytes need G7 native preparation/qualification, check07 and fresh ordered reviews. No live endpoint, credential, publication or release operation.\n1980:async fn guarded_resolution_save_failure(completion: bool, kind: &str) {\n2053:        \"save refusal preserves the exact native guard\"\n2120:async fn select_archive_resolution_save_failure_preserves_pending_work() {\n2121:    guarded_resolution_save_failure(false, \"archive\").await;\n2124:async fn select_discard_resolution_save_failure_preserves_pending_work() {\n2125:    guarded_resolution_save_failure(false, \"discard\").await;\n2128:async fn setup_archive_resolution_save_failure_preserves_pending_work() {\n2129:    guarded_resolution_save_failure(true, \"archive\").await;\n2132:async fn setup_discard_resolution_save_failure_preserves_pending_work() {\n2133:    guarded_resolution_save_failure(true, \"discard\").await;\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
