parison and exact executable are retained. Current source additionally has the disclosed test-only import-cut observer and the C30 production switch-guard remediation: native-issued source-context/refusal references, exact pending-conversation/target/setup-generation validation, and renderer retry retirement. Thus authority/contracts/wizard files are not claimed byte-identical to the L19 qualification tree. Inspect the scoped exact production diff. The historical live operation exercised first-run management verification, not a pending Harness switch or setup completion; its single successful read remains historical evidence, not a new live qualification of current bytes. No product call was repeated and no live allowance remains. Both temporary qualification credentials were removed.',\ntools/p09/make-remedial-packet.py:165: 'All current native integration is complete before this review. Current source, compiled inputs, scoped native evidence and failed-history provenance remain frozen. The P09 phase review remains a separate full gate after C29–C32 pass.'\ntools/p09/make-remedial-packet.py:167:notes.append('Generation 02 C10 stalled twice while describing the production native file panel browser contents; both interrupted attempts have no acceptance verdict. The shared AX helper now scopes native modal sheets to real panel controls, excludes folder scroll contents and modal background, and retains roles/depth/geometry/focus and real actions. Ordinary WebView traversal and every acceptance assertion remain unchanged. Generation 03 repeated the preparation/input seal and all 19 native drivers, which passed. Check04 then failed only Clippy because the fixture observer followed a test module; the unchanged observer was moved before that module with no lint suppression. Generation04 repeats preparation/all19natives; identical executable bytes do not substitute for requalification of the changed helper. Original helper sources, complete generation 02 evidence and failed