ychain namespaces, D001-era identities) and the whole document set; it is its own chunk after P09, not a find-and-replace.\ndocs/planning/status.md:9:completed on 2026-10-24. P08/C26 remains open; the owner-authorized P09\ndocs/planning/status.md:13:under `evidence/P09/native-history/Worf-generation-01-complete-20261101`.\ndocs/planning/status.md:20:fresh checks and C29–C32/P09 reviews. C24-N06 and C31-N01/N04 remain superseded raw\ndocs/planning/status.md:64:| C25–C26 | Owner’s open P08 release phase: C25 historical live qualification accepted at 8; C26 release/install gates remain open | Preserved C26 October signing/install records are historical; pushing current source does not publish a release |\ndocs/planning/status.md:65:| C27 | **Reviewed** (P09, D058): Codex attempt-05 scored 9 in all five dimensions through the fresh-exec fallback (`reviews/C27/attempt-05/receipt.json`); controller receipt and ledger completion regenerate once C26 completes | Attempts 01–04 remediated (`reviews/C27/remediation-attempt-0{1..4}.md`); follow-ups in `reviews/C27/follow-ups.md` |\ndocs/planning/status.md:66:| C28 | **Reviewed** (P09, D058): Codex attempt-09 scored 9 in all five dimensions through the fresh-exec fallback (`reviews/C28/attempt-09/receipt.json`); native acceptance C28-N01–N07 recorded on the prepared fixture bundle; controller receipt and ledger completion regenerate once C26 completes | Attempts 01–08 remediated (`reviews/C28/remediation-attempt-0{1..8}.md`); follow-up in `reviews/C28/follow-ups.md` |\ndocs/planning/status.md:67:| C29 | **Accepted at 8, remediation active** (P09, D034/D058): fresh read-only Codex attempt-07 scored **9/9/9/8/8**, no blockers; schema/hash/input audit passed; receipt `reviews/C29/attempt-07/receipt.json`. Actual authorized Vulture first-run verification passed on L19 attempt-03; the former live blocker is closed | R1/E1: restore retained Gateway, rejected/fixed/stale verification and keyed Cancel native assertions. R2/E2: all first