/planning/evidence/P09/native/cumulative/C24/native-acceptance.json:78:      \"description\": \"The cumulative T09 matrix: every earlier chunk's native acceptance (C01\\u2013C23) passes again on this bundle (their records under this chunk's evidence), covering menus, shortcuts, keyboard and focus, Accessibility roles and names, zoom, minimum window size, themes and reduced motion for every workflow.\",\ndocs/planning/evidence/P09/native/cumulative/C31/native-acceptance.json:65:      \"description\": \"The accessibility additions (DESIGN-V2 \\u00a78) on the changed UI: the review sheet is the one topmost modal (the rail hidden beneath it) and Escape closes it with focus returned to the page; the rotation reminder leaves the Inbox once the old key is read back gone; Tab from a product header reaches its tabs; at the 900\\u00d7600 minimum and 200% zoom in both themes nothing on the Administration screen lies past the window's right edge; a focused review-sheet control shows its focus ring (pixels around it change against the unfocused capture); the applied result and the rotation's completion sit in polite status regions; with Reduce Motion on, the applied change's toast stays past 6 s until dismissed, and the system setting is restored.\",\ndocs/planning/evidence/P09/native/cumulative/C31/native-acceptance.json:67:      \"observation\": \"rotation sheet topmost (rail hidden) True; Escape closed True returning focus to 'Administration' (True); reminder cleared after completion True; Tab from the Runtime header reached its tabs False; at 900\\u00d7600 and 200% overflow light 0 px, dark 0 px; focus ring on the review sheet's Close 496 px changed (True); applied result in a status region True; rotation completion announced in the panel's status region True; Reduce Motion active True: the applied toast shown True, still present after 8 s True, dismissed True, setting restored True\",\ndocs/planning/evidence/P09/native/cumulative/C31/native-acceptance.json:70:        \"docs