orded in evidence/C36/parity/notes.md).\"), ('C36-N02', \"Keyboard and layout (T09): Tab from the heading reaches Refresh, each card, the attention row's controls and the quick actions in order, with the focus ring on a card; Enter on a card opens its product; Home at 1440 wide by the display's full working height and at 900×600 with 200% zoom, in light and dark, with no horizontal overflow; every row records the WebView's measured size from the accessibility tree and asserts it.\")]\nCAPTURES ['screens/home-light.png', 'screens/layouts-home-1440x900-light.png', 'screens/layouts-home-900x600-200-dark.png', 'screens/layouts-home-1440x900-dark.png', 'screens/home-dark.png', 'screens/layouts-home-900x600-200-light.png', 'native/captures/card-ring.png', 'native/captures/home-light.png', 'native/captures/card-ring-plain.png', 'native/captures/home-900x600-200-dark.png', 'native/captures/home-900x600-200-light.png', 'native/captures/home-1440x900-light.png', 'native/captures/home-dark.png', 'native/captures/home-1440x900-dark.png']\nC37 [('C37-N01', \"The Inbox as the prototype draws it (R2App start=inbox) with a tenant whose read has landed: the heading and its line naming the tenant; a 430px list card with the filter tabs (All, Needs action, Updates, Snoozed, each with its count) over the rows (severity tile and word, title, product and source, when; an acknowledged row marked) and a footer naming the read's coverage; selecting a row fills the detail card (severity tile and word, product and source, the 22px title, the body, the facts as a three-column grid, the entry's own action, Acknowledge or Mark as needing action, Snooze or Unsnooze); the empty states name the read (first read pending; the failed first read, every source answering 500; with the sessions chart denied, AI Runtime Security needing a role: Open role issue offered, the footer's partial coverage, the empty pane qualifying what was read and naming the unread source rather than a bare all-clear, and the issue opening that product in Administration); snooze, acknowledge and unsnooze stay the C30 core intents with the core's return time stated the same in the row, the detail and the toast (D059 parity: the composites under evidence/C37/parity are captured by this script from the populated state with the first row opened, parity/bundle.json rewritten with the bundle they came from, and the owner's approval of them is recorded in parity/notes.md).\"), ('C37-N02', \"Keyboard and layout (T09): the Inbox at 1440 wide by the display's working height and at 900×600 with 200% zoom, in light and dark, with the list populated; at each layout no horizontal overflow, the list card at least 160 CSS px tall with its tabs, first row and footer inside its own frame (nothing clipped), Tab from Read now reaching a tab then a row, and Enter on a focused row the detail does not show (scrolled into the viewport by its focus) changing the detail to it; the focus ring on the first row; every row records the WebView's measured size and the viewport from its own tree and asserts them.\")]\nCAPTURES ['parity/inbox-dark.png', 'parity/inbox-light.png', 'screens/inbox-role-light.png', 'screens/layouts-inbox-1440x900-light.png', 'screens/layouts-inbox-1440x900-dark.png', 'screens/layouts-inbox-900x600-200-light.png', 'screens/inbox-failed-light.png', 'screens/layouts-inbox-900x600-200-dark.png', 'screens/inbox-empty-light.png', 'screens/inbox-dark.png', 'screens/inbox-light.png', 'parity/app/inbox-dark.png', 'parity/app/inbox-light.png', 'parity/proto/inbox-dark.png', 'parity/proto/inbox-light.png', 'native/captures/inbox-1440x900-dark.png', 'native/captures/row-ring.png', 'native/captures/parity-inbox-dark.png', 'native/captures/inbox-1440x900-light.png', 'native/captures/inbox-failed-light.png', 'native/captures/inbox-empty-light.png', 'native/captures/inbox-900x600-200-light.png', 'native/captures/row-ring-plain.png', 'native/captures/inbox-role-issue-light.png', 'native/captures/inbox-dark.png', 'native/captures/inbox-900x600-200-dark.png', 'native/captures/parity-inbox-light.png', 'native/captures/inbox-light.png']\nC38 [('C38-N01', \"The Harness as the prototype board draws it (R2App start=harness) with a tenant, the Gateway workspace Team A chosen and its inference key stored, on the real pinned engine against the synthetic Gateway: the title band (heading; the tenant · engine · workspace line; End conversation beside the heading only while a conversation runs) over three columns; the rail labelled 'Saved conversations · encrypted' with New investigation and the live conversation's row; the transcript with the operator's message and the Harness's answer, and the composer whose Send is a button; the Decisions aside saying 'Nothing to decide yet' and listing the workspace's MCP catalog (both synthetic servers, each 'Not signed in') until a read-only desktop read waits, then holding that decision (airs_desktop.mcpServers, Read-only, Approve once / Decline) with the transcript's pending line; allowed in the aside the read is made once and the answer follows, the aside empty again. The parity composites (evidence/C38/parity, prototype left, app right at the WebView's measured size, light and dark) are captured from the state with the decision waiting; the owner's judgement is recorded in parity/notes.md before the gate (D059).\"), ('C38-N03', \"The tenant-switch guard (invariant I1) on the board with a Harness decision waiting: choosing the other tenant from the switcher, from the palette's Switch to entry and from Go › Switch Tenant… each shows the one guard dialog (Stay, Discard and switch, Archive and switch; naming the target tenant; focus on Stay); Escape and Stay keep the first tenant and the waiting decision; Archive and switch ends the conversation with the decision untaken, lands the other tenant on Home and leaves no engine, with nothing further run (C30-N01 carried onto the C38 board in C44).\"), ('C38-N02', \"Keyboard and layout (T09) with a decision waiting: Tab from End conversation reaches New investigation, the composer (Message) and its reachable action (Stop answering while the engine's turn waits on the decision, since Send is disabled until nothing is pending), then the aside's Approve once and Decline, in that order; the focus ring on that action; the Harness at 1440 wide by the display's working height and at 900×600 with 200% zoom, in light and dark, with the decision card populated, no horizontal overflow, New investigation, Send and Approve once each at least 32 CSS px, the rail, the composer and the aside side by side at 100% and one below the other at 200%; every row records the WebView's measured size and the viewport from its own tree and asserts them; the decision declined and the conversation ended leaves no engine.\")]\nCAPTURES ['parity/harness-light.png', 'parity/harness-dark.png', 'screens/harness-decision-dark-200.png', 'screens/layouts-harness-900x600-200-light.png', 'screens/harness-decision-dark-100.png', 'screens/layouts-harness-900x600-200-dark.png', 'screens/harness-guard-light.png', 'screens/harness-empty-light-200.png', 'screens/layouts-harness-1440x900-dark.png', 'screens/harness-decision-light-200.png', 'screens/harness-ring-focused.png', 'screens/harness-empty-dark-200.png', 'screens/harness-empty-light-100.png', 'screens/harness-decision-light-100.png', 'screens/layouts-harness-1440x900-light.png', 'screens/harness-empty-dark-100.png', 'screens/harness-ring-plain.png', 'parity/app/harness-light.png', 'parity/app/harness-dark.png', 'parity/proto/harness-light.png', 'parity/proto/harness-dark.png', 'native/captures/parity-harness-light.png', 'native/captures/harness-900x600-200-light.png', 'native/captures/harness-decision-dark-200.png', 'native/captures/parity-harness-dark.png', 'native/captures/harness-decision-dark-100.png', 'native/captures/harness-guard-light.png', 'native/captures/harness-1440x900-light.png', 'native/captures/harness-empty-light-200.png', 'native/ca