hose read has landed through the synthetic management plane: the heading and its line (tenant · every change is reviewed before it is applied) with Expand all and Collapse all; the six product cards in order, each with its description, headline figure, status pill and alerts (AI Runtime Security: its detection events from the read, Connected; the agentic products Not available); AI Runtime Security open on Custom topics: the tab strip (Overview, Playground, Security profiles, Custom topics, Applications, API keys, DLP, Deployment profiles), the search field, New topic…, the table's rows from the plane with View per row and the footer's count and read time; View opens the detail with exactly the admitted actions; the Overview tab's three tiles and 24-hour bars from the same read; the Playground tab's form (profile, prompt, response, application, Scan, Save as test case…) and the verdict card after a synthetic scan; Expand all opens every available product and Collapse all closes them (D059 parity: the composites under evidence/C39/parity are captured by this script from this state, the owner's judgement recorded in parity/notes.md). Other products' tab bodies remain C39b's.\"), ('C39-N02', \"A change through the prototype's review sheet (R2App start=review): Edit… on a custom topic's detail opens the sheet docked to the window's right edge under the header, 620 CSS px wide, titled 'Review a change' with the review's state pill (Draft, then Ready for review, then Applied) and a Close review control; Review change prepares the review in the core, Apply… stays disabled while the typed name is empty or wrong and enables on the exact name, the native confirmation names the update, and the applied result is read back live with one write to the plane; Done closes the sheet. The review composites (parity/review-*) are captured with the sheet open on the draft.\"), ('C39-N03', \"The other products on the card pattern (C39b): AI Gateway with the workspace Team A chosen — the Workspaces tab's chooser and the chosen workspace's settings read with its admitted Edit… / Archive…, the Routes tab as a table with search, New route… and a detail whose actions are the inventory's, the Keys tab with the service / user kinds; AI Red Teaming — the Overview's summary tiles and ranked bars, the Targets table with Results per target (identifiers only), the Scans tab's list without the tiles; Model and skill scans — the Model scans table (or the plane's 'none read') and Codebase scans not available in this release. Every table is read through the management client and says its coverage.\"), ('C39-N04', \"Keyboard and layout (T09): Tab from the heading reaches Expand all, the Runtime card's header, its tabs and the table's first View in order, the focus ring on the first View; Administration at 1440 wide by the display's working height and at 900×600 with 200% zoom, in light and dark, with Runtime open on Custom topics and no horizontal overflow, the tab strip scrolling within the card rather than widening it, the table's header, first row and footer inside the card; every row records the WebView's measured size and the viewport from its own tree and asserts them.\")]\nCAPTURES ['parity/admin-light.png', 'parity/review-dark.png', 'parity/admin-dark.png', 'parity/review-light.png', 'screens/gateway-routes-light.png', 'screens/admin-playground-light.png', 'screens/admin-light.png', 'screens/layouts-admin-1440x1452-dark.png', 'screens/red-team-overview-light.png', 'screens/admin-ring-focused.png', 'screens/layouts-admin-900x600-200-dark.png', 'screens/layouts-admin-900x600-200-light.png', 'screens/admin-overview-light.png', 'screens/admin-ring-plain.png', 'screens/layouts-admin-1440x1452-light.png', 'screens/review-applied-light.png', 'parity/app/admin-light.png', 'parity/app/review-dark.png', 'parity/app/admin-dark.png', 'parity/app/review-light.png', 'parity/proto/admin-light.png', 'parity/proto/review-dark.png', 'parity/proto/admin-dark.png', 'parity/proto/review-light.png', 'native/captures/admin-1440x1452-dark.png', 'native/captures/gateway-routes-light.png', 'native/captures/admin-playground-light.png', 'native/captures/parity-admin-dark.png', 'native/captures/parity-review-light.png', 'native/captures/admin-light.png', 'native/captures/parity-admin-light.png', 'native/captures/red-team-overview-light.png', 'native/captures/admin-ring-view.png', 'native/captures/parity-review-dark.png', 'native/captures/admin-900x600-200-dark.png', 'native/captures/admin-overview-light.png', 'native/captures/admin-900x600-200-light.png', 'native/captures/admin-ring-plain.png', 'native/captures/review-applied-light.png', 'native/captures/admin-1440x1452-light.png']\n    n2 = {}\n    # From Read now (the heading's Tab did not move focus in the fixture): the tabs, the rows, the detail's actions.\n    app.ax(\"focus\", \"AXButton\", \"Read now\")\n    time.sleep(0.3)\n    walk = [(((f or {}).get(\"label\")) or \"\")[:44] for f in app.tab_walk(14)]\n    n2[\"walk\"] = walk\n    order = []\n    for key in (\"All\", rows[0][\"label\"][:12] if rows else \"\", \"Acknowledge\"):\n        idx = next((i for i, l in enumerate(walk) if key and l.startswith(key)), None)\n        order.append((key, idx))\n    n2[\"order\"] = order\n    n2[\"reach_in_order\"] = all(i is not None for _, i in order) and [i for _, i in order] == sorted(i for _, i in order)\n    plain = c29.capture(app, \"row-ring-plain\")\n    n2[\"ring\"] = c31.ring_on(app, rows[0][\"label\"], plain, \"row-ring\") if rows else {\"diff\": 0}\n    ring_ok = (n2[\"ring\"].get(\"diff\") or 0) > 40\n    if rows:\n        app.ax(\"focus\", \"AXButton\", rows[0][\"label\"][:60])\n        time.sleep(0.3)\n        app.keycode(36)\n        _, n2[\"enter_opens\"] = app.wait_for(lambda t: region(t, \"Details\") is not None and any(n.get(\"role\") == \"AXHeading\" and (n.get(\"label\") or \"\") in (rows[0][\"label\"] or \"\") for n in within(t, region(t, \"Details\"))), 8)\n    layouts = {}\n    size_window(app, pid, 1440, 900)\n    for theme in (\"Light\", \"Dark\"):\n        c29.appearance(app, theme)\n        time.sleep(0.4)\n        o, tree = overflow(app)\n        g = geometry_of(tree)\n        o[\"geometry\"] = g\n        o[\"width_1440\"] = bool(g[\"web\"] and g[\"web\"][0] == 1440)\n        o[\"list\"] = list_usable(tree, 1, app)\n        name = f\"inbox-{g['web'][0]}x{g['web'][1]}-{theme.lower()}\"\n        o[\"capture\"] = c29.capture(app, name)\n        o[\"tree\"] = c29.save_tree(name, tree)\n        o[\"keyboard\"] = keyboard_at(app)\n        layouts[name] = o\n    size_window(app, pid, 900, 600)\n    c29.zoom(app, 10)\n    for theme in (\"Light\", \"Dark\"):\n        c29.appearance(app, theme)\n        time.sleep(0.4)\n        # The list card is measured where it stands: scrolled into view by focusing its first tab.\n        tab = tab_node(app.tree(), \"All\")\n        app.ax(\"focus\", tab[\"role\"], tab[\"label\"]) if tab else None\n        time.sleep(0.4)\n        o, tree = overflow(app)\n        g = geometry_of(tree)\n        vp = g[\"viewport\"] or g[\"web\"]\n        o[\"geometry\"] = g\n        o[\"window_900x600\"] = bool(vp and vp[0] == 900 and vp[1] == 600 and g[\"web\"] and g[\"web\"][0] == 900)\n        o[\"list\"] = list_usable(tree, 2, app)\n        name = f\"inbox-{vp[0]}x{vp[1]}-200-{theme.lower()}\"\n        o[\"capture\"] = c29.capture(app, name)\n        o[\"tree\"] = c29.save_tree(name, tree)\n        o[\"keyboard\"] = keyboard_at(app)\n        layouts[name] = o\n    c29.zoom(app, -10)\n    c29.appearance(app, \"Match System\")\n    size_window(app, pid, 1440, 900)\n    n2[\"layouts\"] = layouts\n    obs[\"captures\"][\"layouts\"] = {k: v[\"capture\"] for k, v in layouts.items()}\n    obs[\"n2\"] = n2\n    app.quit()\n\n    run_path = os.path.join(NATIVE, \"observations.json\")\n    with open(run_path, \"w\") as f:\n        json.dump(json.loads(json.dumps({\"observations\": obs, \"log\": LOG}).replace(rel(NATIVE), rel(FIN